{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 8700272267374238247,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "View all comments link",
      "source_hash": 4146726417423705969,
      "context_hash": 1669355459791381462,
      "translation": "모든 댓글 보기 링크",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:47:04.253201Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "\"View all comments\" links are simple hyperlinks automatically added by triagebot to a PR or issue description.",
      "source_hash": 18428262352083860930,
      "context_hash": 987735183504594891,
      "translation": "\"모든 댓글 보기\" 링크는 triagebot이 풀 리퀘스트나 이슈 설명에 자동으로 추가하는 단순한 하이퍼링크입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "triagebot": "triagebot",
        "issue": "이슈"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T13:18:37.074036Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "They link to triagebot comments viewer for GitHub issues and PRs.",
      "source_hash": 16138176958849489607,
      "context_hash": 4080293855008605472,
      "translation": "이 링크는 GitHub 이슈와 풀 리퀘스트를 위한 triagebot 댓글 뷰어로 연결됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "triagebot": "triagebot"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T13:18:37.074037Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "As its name implies, these links load all the comments (and review comments) from GitHub and display them all at once.",
      "source_hash": 7976859243780740383,
      "context_hash": 4690372963598240571,
      "translation": "이름에서 알 수 있듯이, 이 링크는 GitHub로부터 모든 댓글(및 리뷰 댓글)을 불러와 한 번에 모두 표시합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:47:04.253202Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "This is in contrast to the GitHub UI, where one has to click on \"Load More\" multiple times to see the full conversation.",
      "source_hash": 16158915067664243315,
      "context_hash": 930127642024053115,
      "translation": "이는 전체 대화를 보려면 \"Load More\"를 여러 번 클릭해야 하는 GitHub UI와 대조됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:47:04.253203Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Configuration",
      "source_hash": 4935613502183038470,
      "context_hash": 17442551085050868964,
      "translation": "설정",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:47:04.253203Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "This feature is enabled on a repository by having a `[view-all-comments-link]` table in `triagebot.toml`:",
      "source_hash": 11182295908239044681,
      "context_hash": 1983766203024449472,
      "translation": "이 기능은 `triagebot.toml`에 `[view-all-comments-link]` 테이블을 두면 저장소에서 활성화됩니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:47:04.253203Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "All the options are optional.",
      "source_hash": 8874507655556323800,
      "context_hash": 16655139618981733811,
      "translation": "모든 옵션은 선택 사항입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:47:04.253203Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "The \"View all comments\" links will point to triagebot's `/gh-comments` endpoint - our GitHub's comments viewer.",
      "source_hash": 12440343379049542619,
      "context_hash": 3862641395023657304,
      "translation": "\"모든 댓글 보기\" 링크는 triagebot의 `/gh-comments` 엔드포인트, 즉 저희 GitHub 댓글 뷰어를 가리킵니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "triagebot": "triagebot"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T13:18:37.074037Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Implementation",
      "source_hash": 14188291987651099077,
      "context_hash": 6622536301606039527,
      "translation": "구현",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:47:04.253204Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "See [`src/handlers/view_all_comments_link.rs`](https://github.com/rust-lang/triagebot/blob/HEAD/src/handlers/view_all_comments_link.rs).",
      "source_hash": 12209900755613064216,
      "context_hash": 5801226501789644448,
      "translation": "[`src/handlers/view_all_comments_link.rs`](https://github.com/rust-lang/triagebot/blob/HEAD/src/handlers/view_all_comments_link.rs)를 참고하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:47:04.253204Z",
      "issues": []
    }
  ]
}